# Supabase Cloud Auth & Encrypted Database Configuration
# 1. Create a project at https://supabase.com and run supabase/schema.sql in the SQL Editor.
# 2. Copy Project URL and anon/public key from Project Settings -> API.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-supabase-anon-key
